<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλήν-ιος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάνιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span> (also in <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Eq.</u>
			1253
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,= foreg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς Ἑ., Ἀθανᾶ
		Ἑ</span>., Rhetra ap.<i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			<u>Lyc.</u>
			6
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Συλλ-</span> codd.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς Ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			9.7
		</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, cf.<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>N.</u>
			5.10
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(5).910
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tenos</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνᾶ Ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Hipp.</u>
			1121
		</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ οἱ Ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			5.49
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			92
		</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Herc.</u>
			2
		</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
			Hld.
			2.23
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλήνιον, τό</span>, <i>Greek factory</i> (with temples of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεοὶ Ἑλλήνιοι</span>) at
			Naucratis, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.178
			</span></i>; also of buildings at Arsinoe and Memphis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				133.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				221
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλανία, ἡ</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1147
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.</div>
